  "review": "<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 mb-4\">【2026】島根県といえばコレ！出雲大社・世界遺産石見銀山＆しまね和牛・日本海海鮮おすすめ宿比較！玉造・三瓶・隠岐</h2>\n\n<div class=\"my-6 p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50 via-cyan-50/40 to-stone-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-3xl shadow-sm space-y-3\">\n  <h3 class=\"text-base font-bold text-amber-950 flex items-center gap-2\">⛩️ 縁結びの聖地「出雲大社」と日本最古の美肌温泉「玉造温泉」</h3>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed\">神話の国・島根県。縁結びの大親神を祀る「出雲大社」、世界遺産「石見銀山」、ユネスコ世界ジオパーク「隠岐諸島」。化粧水のような潤いをもたらす玉造温泉や、幻のブランド肉「しまね和牛・隠岐牛」、出雲そば、日本海のノドグロ・岩牡蠣を堪能できます。</p>\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-2 my-6 flex items-center gap-2\">🏆 島根県を代表する名湯と美食の宿</h2>\n\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">第1位</span>\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">出雲・玉造温泉　白石家</h3>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.71</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"mb-4\"><img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/78179/78179.jpg\" alt=\"出雲・玉造温泉　白石家 外観・客室\" class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-950 bg-amber-50 p-2.5 rounded-xl mb-3 border border-amber-100\">✨ 【出雲・玉造温泉】創業300年の老舗美肌温泉旅館！毎夜の縁結びライブとしまね和牛会席</p>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">玉造温泉街の中心に佇む名旅館。美肌効果抜群の檜露天風呂や大浴場、毎夜ロビーで開催される安来節・縁結びライブ、しまね和牛と日本海の鮮魚会席が最高峰。</p>\n  \n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5 my-3 text-xs\">\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-stone-50 rounded-xl border border-stone-200\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">👤 こんな旅におすすめ：</strong>女子旅、カップル、出雲大社参拝客、極上美肌温泉を求める人</div>\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-emerald-50/60 rounded-xl border border-emerald-200\"><strong class=\"text-emerald-950\">🎯 選ぶ決め手：</strong>玉造温泉屈指の美肌の湯と出雲大社アクセスなら迷わずここ！</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pt-3 text-center\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D78179\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition transform\">\n      ✈️ 【公式楽天トラベル】出雲・玉造温泉　白石家 の最新空室・最安値プランを見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">第2位</span>\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">ドラマチックな自然体験に出逢える高原ホテル　三瓶温泉　さひめ野</h3>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"mb-4\"><img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/67801/67801.jpg\" alt=\"ドラマチックな自然体験に出逢える高原ホテル　三瓶温泉　さひめ野 外観・客室\" class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-950 bg-amber-50 p-2.5 rounded-xl mb-3 border border-amber-100\">✨ 【三瓶山・石見銀山拠点】満天星空パノラマと赤褐色のにごり湯露天風呂</p>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">三瓶山の大自然に抱かれた高原ホテル。含鉄塩化物泉の濃厚なにごり湯露天風呂と、しまね和牛や三瓶そば会席が好評。</p>\n  \n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5 my-3 text-xs\">\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-stone-50 rounded-xl border border-stone-200\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">👤 こんな旅におすすめ：</strong>ご夫婦、ファミリー、世界遺産石見銀山観光派</div>\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-emerald-50/60 rounded-xl border border-emerald-200\"><strong class=\"text-emerald-950\">🎯 選ぶ決め手：</strong>三瓶山パノラマと濃厚にごり湯露天風呂ならここ！</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pt-3 text-center\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D67801\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition transform\">\n      ✈️ 【公式楽天トラベル】ドラマチックな自然体験に出逢える高原ホテル　三瓶温泉　さひめ野 の最新空室・最安値プランを見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">第3位</span>\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">Ｅｎｔｏ＜隠岐諸島＞</h3>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.63</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"mb-4\"><img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/18535/18535.jpg\" alt=\"Ｅｎｔｏ＜隠岐諸島＞ 外観・客室\" class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-950 bg-amber-50 p-2.5 rounded-xl mb-3 border border-amber-100\">✨ 【隠岐諸島・海士町】世界ジオパークの泊まれる拠点！海を望むミニマル客室と島フレンチ</p>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">海士町・菱浦港直結の話題のジオホテル。客室の窓から日本海と島影を望み、島の旬魚や幻の隠岐牛フレンチが至高の評価。</p>\n  \n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5 my-3 text-xs\">\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-stone-50 rounded-xl border border-stone-200\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">👤 こんな旅におすすめ：</strong>デザイン好き、カップル、特別な島時間を過ごしたい人</div>\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-emerald-50/60 rounded-xl border border-emerald-200\"><strong class=\"text-emerald-950\">🎯 選ぶ決め手：</strong>ジオパークの絶景と洗練された島フレンチならここ！</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pt-3 text-center\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D18535\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition transform\">\n      ✈️ 【公式楽天トラベル】Ｅｎｔｏ＜隠岐諸島＞ の最新空室・最安値プランを見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>"
